WEBVTT

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:14.320
Magical Stage!

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:03.530
Oh no! I accidentally fell asleep.

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:11.630
Yes, yes, with this I can...

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:16.200
Plush-chan...

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:17.610
Ah, found it.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:21.700
But... I'm sure that I was hugging you while sleeping.

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:23.190
When did you...

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:25.860
Don't tell me you went over there by yourself?

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.630
Impossible, right?

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:34.060
Plush-chan!

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:43.060
Majo Ruka VS Level 6 Ojamajos!

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:53.480
That's great that your dad threw away Majo Ruka's magic item, Ai-chan.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:54.230
Thank you.

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:56.570
But how about your family, Doremi-chan?

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:00.020
They haven't thrown it away yet.

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:00.530
I see.

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:03.530
There's still a lotta people with 'em in this town.

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:08.500
I wonder if we can disable those magic goods using Magical Stage from our new Porons.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.280
That's impossible.

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:15.710
Even though we passed the level 6 exam, Lala told me that our magic is still too weak.

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:20.200
So we hafta ask Majo Rika fer help again like last time?

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:23.550
Let's go ask Majo Rika for help.

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:26.780
W-Well, Majo Rika is...

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:39.900
Plush-chan, you sure are popular!

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:44.870
Now I can't get my Crystal back.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:46.820
Something like that.

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:55.290
Hehe!

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:58.670
Bring me my underwear and a bathrobe!

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:00.260
What a pain...

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:08.820
Oh yeah, help me wash those clothes too!

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:11.280
Okay, okay.

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:15.520
God, she's so irritating...

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:18.020
No, she just likes to make her fairy work.

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:24.660
Give me back my money!

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.450
How dare you sell us fake magic goods!

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:28.660
What's all this ruckus?

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:30.750
What's the matter?

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:31.620
Please calm down.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:35.830
Your magic goods, even though they can make our wishes come true,

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:38.130
people have been getting hurt or sick as a result!

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.590
That's just a rumor!

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:42.550
In any case, give back our money.

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:43.930
Yeah!

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:46.970
If they didn't make your wish come true, we'll give back your money.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:49.970
Our magic goods work 100% of the time.

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.020
You swindlers, pay up!

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.010
I want to return this!

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:58.980
Shut up!

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:03.490
Majo Ruka-sama!

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.820
I'm the owner of this store.

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:10.160
According to policy, those who want to return their goods for a refund are rejected.

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.320
Please go home.

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:31.720
Those stupid humans.

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:35.180
I told you that even though your magic goods do make wishes come true,

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:40.570
you should have told your customers about those bad side effects.

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:41.440
Shut up!

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:44.820
I can't sell my goods if I tell people that!

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:47.360
I'm going to go take another bath.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:50.030
You guys, clean up the store!

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:51.710
Okay...

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:02.080
Hehe-san!

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.130
Coming.

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:08.090
Um, some things are completely broken and are unsellable, what should we do with them?

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:11.890
They're collecting the trash today, right? Just throw them all away.

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:12.600
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:13.940
Hehe-san.

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:14.560
What?

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:18.060
This crystal looks like it can still be used.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:20.520
Who cares, just throw it all away.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.480
Yes ma'am.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:27.030
Trash Bag

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:28.740
There we go.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:31.270
We're done, we're done.

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:34.660
Trash Collection

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:37.340
Okay, go!

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:57.580
What!?

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:05.440
Hey, Majo Ruka!

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:06.850
Wake up!

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:08.300
No use.

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:13.030
You actually threw away my Crystal with the rest of the trash!?

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.410
I wasn't the one who threw it away!

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.580
The bat and the mouse did it!

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.000
But Hehe-san told us to!

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:20.500
You lie! I didn't say that!

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.500
Yes, you did!

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:22.380
No, I didn't!

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:23.240
Yes, you did!

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:24.500
No, I didn't!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:25.670
Yes, you did!

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:26.710
No, I didn't! No, I didn't!

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:28.460
Yes, you did! Yes, you did!

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:29.800
Enough!

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.430
Go find it right this minute!

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:33.430
Yes ma'am!

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:37.250
That was fun. Things have really taken a turn for the interesting.

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:43.730
Okay, everyone, have you changed into your swimsuits yet?

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:45.110
Yes!

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.900
Okay, let's go to the pool.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:04.080
My precious Crystal!

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.390
Plush-chan!

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.920
Oh whoops, Majo Rika.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.880
What is it, Lala?

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.930
Majo Rika, I have big news.

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:14.010
Big news?

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:15.050
Yeah!

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:16.470
Majo Ruka...

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:18.890
And then... and then!

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:20.260
That happened!

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:22.980
This really is big news.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:27.820
If we can find Majo Ruka's Crystal, we can get our store back!

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:29.820
Now's also the right time for you to run away.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:31.780
Okay, let's go, Lala.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:33.240
Okay.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:40.720
Hey! What are you doing to my Plush-chan!

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:45.120
Okay, Plush-chan, time to go swimming with me!

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:48.340
I can't ask Majo Rika for help now.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:50.050
Oh well.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:52.510
I have to ask Doremi and the others now.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:53.940
It's not here...

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:54.970
It isn't...

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:57.090
Maybe it's not on this truck...

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:57.970
Maybe...

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:00.430
How troublesome.

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:02.890
Nope... nope...

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:06.730
Let's take a break.

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:07.900
How about some tea?

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:08.610
I agree.

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.560
Looks like they haven't found it yet.

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:14.200
That's how it is.

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:18.160
Majo Rika has completely turned into Plush-chan.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:21.120
Wasn't it Doremi who did that to her?

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:24.540
But... Majo Rika was...

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:28.670
And I didn't know that Pop would take her Crystal.

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:29.590
That's why...

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:32.710
Well, it's no use saying that now.

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:37.720
Right now, we have to find Majo Ruka's Crystal before she does.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:38.470
Yeah.

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:40.720
That's right, let's do it.

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:43.770
The teacher is coming!

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:44.430
Oh no!

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:47.220
Okay, we'll talk about it after class!

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:07.840
Good-bye, Teacher!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.330
Let's go, everyone!

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:11.410
Okay!

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:13.380
Do your best, everyone!

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:16.720
I think the trash has been taken to the trash yard already.

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:17.340
Yeah.

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:18.470
Okay, let's go.

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:20.010
For the love of...

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.180
When are they going to find it?

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:23.920
Those useless so-and-so's...

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:31.730
Those fools...

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:33.820
We hafta look <i>here</i> ?

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:35.150
There's too much!

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:36.740
But we have to do it.

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:37.950
What are you saying?

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:40.200
Now's a good time to test the power of your Kuruuru Porons.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.160
Oh yeah!

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.570
Hey, can I do it? Can I?

00:10:44.570 --> 00:10:45.240
Go ahead.

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:46.270
Thank you!

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:59.510
It's the first time! I'm getting excited!

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:00.860
Okay!

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:05.260
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:08.560
Majo Ruka's Crystal, come out!

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:26.330
Eh?

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:27.450
Doremi-chan.

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.290
Look.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.660
Yes!

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:58.280
I didn't think that it would be at the trash yard!

00:11:58.280 --> 00:11:59.990
That's my Majo Ruka-sama.

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:01.530
No wonder you guys are a bat and a mouse.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.280
You're too late.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:10.250
We've found your Crystal already!

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:14.210
You Ojamajos... give it back to me!

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:17.040
Sure, but we have a request.

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:18.520
A request!?

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:22.880
What is this request of yours?

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.720
Isn't it obvious?

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:25.340
The store's deed!

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:27.390
Disable all of your magic goods!

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:28.220
Eh?

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:31.310
We won't let you guys hurt everyone any longer!

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:34.600
And we ain't gonna letcha sell yer magic goods anymore!

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:37.110
Um... Yeah, yeah!

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:41.320
I've got no choice...

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:44.110
I understand. I'll do what you ask.

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:45.610
Eh, really?

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:48.240
Ahh, but of course.

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:52.310
After seeing the three of you work so hard, my mind is clear now.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:56.420
Here, please give me back my Crystal. Hurry!

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:57.290
Okay!

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:04.080
I think you should disable those magic goods first.

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:06.220
Are you a fool?

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:09.430
Without my Crystal, how will I use magic?

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:11.360
Oh yeah.

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:13.300
Then...

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:17.270
Later.

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:18.670
Thanks for that.

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:21.770
Hey, hold on a second! What about your magic goods!?

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:24.950
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:26.910
How mean!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.190
You tricked us!

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:30.740
Those who are fooled are in the wrong.

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:32.160
So low!

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:33.750
Yer even dirtier than Majo Rika!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:37.170
Dirtier than Majo Rika?

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:39.040
Yeah, yeah!

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.920
Majo Rika's way better than you!

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:47.440
Even though she looks like that now, Majo Rika is much kinder, nicer, and more trustworthy!

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:50.850
I've had it with your attitude.

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:53.100
Bat! Mouse!

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:56.970
Show those Ojamajos just how strong you really are!

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:03.150
They ran away.

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:06.720
They're all useless!

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:14.500
Then I, the next Queen of the Witch World, will show you the true power of a witch!

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:18.120
If you can beat my magic,

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:21.920
I'll disable all of my magic goods and give you back the Maho-dou.

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.920
But if I win,

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:27.880
you have to work in my store for free for the rest of your lives!

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:32.300
Wind

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:40.400
I scared you witless with just that little bit!

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:41.860
That was only a warmup!

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:43.400
What should we do?

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:44.980
Looks like we hafta fight!

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:47.860
We'll use our level 6 magic against her.

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:50.320
Eh? You guys passed level 6?

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:51.450
Yes!

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:54.950
Didn't I tell you to stop them from going to the Witch World!?

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:56.870
Don't worry about that.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:01.210
It doesn't matter if you guys are level 6 or level 5, Ojamajos are still Ojamajos.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:02.920
We definitely won't lose!

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:09.050
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:12.490
Majo Ruka's most hated thing, come out!

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:20.630
Old Man Jokes that are Just Not Funny.

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:24.400
Old man jokes...

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:26.110
She's laughing.

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:27.820
Doremi-chan, read somethin'.

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:28.400
Okay.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:32.700
On Monday, I chatted with three monkeys.

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:35.910
Chatting with monkeys on a Monday!

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:39.330
On Tuesday, the monkeys wore new "tuex-edos."

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.820
On Wednesday, the monkeys were blown over by the "wind."

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:47.880
On Thursday, the monkeys got really "thurs-ty."

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:49.480
What's so funny?

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:57.720
That was pretty good.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.140
But this time I won't go easy on you!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.630
I'll go get Majo Rika!

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:28.380
Here! Plush-chan's the father.

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:30.090
Dinner is ready.

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:31.900
Do you want a beer?

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:33.400
Majo Rika!

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:34.720
Big trouble!

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.290
It's about Majo Ruka...

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:38.230
So...

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:41.070
What is that little thing?

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:43.270
And...

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:44.390
What!?

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:47.360
It talked! Plush-chan...

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:49.320
Oh well, this is better anyway.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.150
Give me my Crystal back.

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:55.650
Am I dreaming?

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:57.700
No, I'm not!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.200
Plush-chan!

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:07.540
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:10.410
Robot, freeze!

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:19.560
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:22.520
Robot, turn small!

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:27.100
It's no use!

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:30.020
I'll flatten all of you.

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:31.190
Help us!

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:32.820
What are you doing!?

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:35.900
Majo Rika!

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:38.200
Calm down for a second and think!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:39.830
Hey, Majo Rika!

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:41.370
Don't you interfere!

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:44.160
This is a fight between me and the Ojamajos.

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.460
I know that already.

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:48.500
The opponent is a worthless piece of trash!

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:50.380
Use your brains!

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:51.880
I can use my mouth, can't I?

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:54.920
Use our brains?

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:56.150
Oh yeah.

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:58.640
I see.

00:17:58.640 --> 00:17:59.470
Good idea!

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:00.600
Okay.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:06.480
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:12.360
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:18.320
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:18:18.580 --> 00:18:20.240
Vacuum cleaner, come out!

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:23.240
Vacuum cleaner, turn big!

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:26.250
Suck in that robot!

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:38.840
Nice triple magic.

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:40.970
Suck in Majo Ruka too!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:03.240
The deed to the store and the business contract are now back in my hands.

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:06.180
The Maho-dou is ours once again.

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:07.450
Yes!

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:09.920
Give back my Crystal now.

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:12.380
You won't pull anything funny again, will you?

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:13.790
Don't worry.

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:18.340
If that happens, we'll tell everyone in the Witch World that she lost to a bunch of level 6 witch apprentices.

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:25.470
Just by that, I don't think she'll try to take over the Maho-dou again.

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:30.390
Hehe, we're going back to the Witch World.

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:31.790
Okay.

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:34.930
I'll take revenge on you someday!

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:37.280
Hey, wait!

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:39.490
You haven't disabled all your magic goods!

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:42.110
Oh well. I can help you with that.

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:48.560
Plush-chan, where did you go?

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:49.760
Over there?

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:59.630
Plush-chan? Plush-chan?

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:01.300
Okay, let's start.

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:02.000
Okay!

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:06.300
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:12.930
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:18.730
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:31.010
Magical Stage!

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:41.090
Disable all of Majo Ruka's magic goods!

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:26.180
Now everything should be fine.

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:28.510
We got the Maho-dou back.

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:29.470
Yep.

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:31.390
We have to work hard again starting tomorrow.

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:35.360
I saw it.

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:38.940
I saw it.

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:49.030
Doremi and her friends...

00:21:49.030 --> 00:21:50.280
are all witc-

00:21:51.270 --> 00:21:54.570
No way! She saw us!

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:56.540
Don't tell me that we'll also become...

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:59.460
Witch Frogs?

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:04.210
Hey, is everyone all right?

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:05.760
I'm froggie Doremi.

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:10.050
I'm froggie Hadzuki-chi, the most beautiful Witch Frog.

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:13.600
Dad, Aiko's been turned into a frog! I'm sorry!

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:16.640
Everyone, even though they became frogs, they'll be fine.

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:18.410
I'm Harukaze Pop!

00:22:18.410 --> 00:22:21.740
From now on, I'm also a witch apprentice.

00:22:21.740 --> 00:22:23.400
Nice to meet you!

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:24.620
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:24.620 --> 00:22:26.400
Ojamajo Pop's Debut!?

00:22:26.530 --> 00:22:29.280
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
